cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PanelPay in your work or research, please cite it as below."
title: "PanelPay: an open-source AWS Lightsail reseller panel with prepaid wallet, billing and automatic provisioning"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rahman"
    given-names: "S M Moshiur"
    website: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/in-moshiur"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bemoshiur/panelpay"
url: "https://tryaws.now"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  PanelPay is a free, open-source control panel and billing system for reselling Amazon Lightsail. It combines
  a prepaid wallet, an append-only double-entry ledger, a multi-account provisioning engine on AWS Lambda and
  SQS, tenant isolation, and Route 53 domains and DNS, built with TypeScript, Next.js, PostgreSQL and SST.
keywords:
  - aws
  - amazon-lightsail
  - reseller
  - hosting-billing
  - whmcs-alternative
  - prepaid-wallet
  - double-entry-ledger
  - multi-tenant
  - route53
  - sst
  - nextjs
  - typescript
